Here is your dark gothic starter template - single file, just save as `index.html` and open/upload:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Artista Erótico - Gothic Atelier</title>
<style>
  :root{--bg:#0a0a0f;--card:#15151c;--accent:#9b2c4a;--accent2:#6a5acd;--text:#e8e0e8}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
  body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);font-family:Georgia,serif;line-height:1.6}
  header{padding:40px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #222}
  header h1{font-size:2.8em;letter-spacing:4px;color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase}
  header p{opacity:0.7;letter-spacing:2px;margin-top:8px}
  nav{margin-top:20px}
  nav a{color:var(--text);margin:0 12px;text-decoration:none;opacity:0.8}
  nav a:hover{color:var(--accent)}
  .hero{padding:60px 20px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#0a0a0f 0%, #1a0f1f 100%)}
  .hero h2{font-size:1.8em;font-weight:300}
  .gallery{max-width:1100px;margin:40px auto;padding:0 20px}
  .gallery h3{letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding-left:12px;margin-bottom:20px}
  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:16px}
  .card{background:var(--card);overflow:hidden;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #222;transition:.3s}
  .card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:var(--accent)}
  .card img{width:100%;height:280px;object-fit:cover;display:block;filter:grayscale(20%) contrast(110%)}
  .card p{padding:12px;font-size:0.9em;opacity:0.8}
  .
